[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4551586224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119800#issuecomment-4551586224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119800","id":4551586224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD0uxsA","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T05:23:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T05:23:54Z","body":"I'm not an expert in multithreading, but as far as I know, `MutexLock` uses the [RAII](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resource_acquisition_is_initialization) idiom, meaning it lasts from the moment the local variable `lock` is created until it's destroyed at the end of the block. By nesting the local variable declaration inside the `if` statement, you've narrowed its lifetime to just that block. So, as far as I understand, the rest of the function is no longer protected by the mutex. Not to mention that when `GDScriptLanguage::get_singleton()` returns `nullptr`, `MutexLock` isn't created at all. Which could potentially cause problems if you have multiple objects in different threads that survive the singleton's deinitialization.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4551586224/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4551862541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119800#issuecomment-4551862541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119800","id":4551862541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD0_pDQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T06:10:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T06:10:17Z","body":"AI slop","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4551862541/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine